Poisoned arrows work wonders, if you've got the necessary skill in
bow. (Master) mind flayers are *not* poison resistant, unlike many of
the other nasties (i.e. liches), and one of my favorite tricks as a
ranger was to fire poisoned arrows at them, four per round, down a
long hallway. They rarely survived the first round. (Of course, you
can only use this if you're neutral/chaotic.)

